{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_011fsyBvW8t1guQ8mmNRutYz", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://qudt.org/vocab/unit/A-PER-M.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.aakash.ac.in/important-concepts/physics/magnetisation-and-magnetic-intensity\"}, {\"url\": \"https://techtarget.com/whatis/definition/ampere-per-meter-A-m-Oe-oersted\"}, {\"url\": \"https://digitalocean.wpcompress.com/blog/unit-of-magnetic-intensity-definition\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.careers360.com/question-a-permanent-magnet-in-the-shape-of-a-thin-cylinder-of-length-10cm-has-m10-power6-am-calculate-magnetization-current\"}, {\"url\": \"https://digitalocean.wpcompress.com/blog/understanding-the-unit-of-magnetic\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.tme.com/ca/en/news/library-articles/glossary/page/69212/magnetisation-magnetisation-definition/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.careers360.com/question-a-permanent-magnet-in-the-shape-of-a-thin-cylinder-of-length-10cm-has-m10-power6-am-calculate-magnetization-current/amp\"}, {\"url\": \"https://learnemc.com/qotw-200914\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T12:56:23.202Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "磁化强度 国际单位制 单位 安培每米 A/m", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_017yk1P43K96nb2KsNdNZEc1", "content": [{"title": "A PER M", "url": "https://qudt.org/vocab/unit/A-PER-M.html"}, {"title": "magnetisation and magnetic intensity", "url": "https://www.aakash.ac.in/important-concepts/physics/magnetisation-and-magnetic-intensity"}, {"title": "ampere per meter A m Oe oersted", "url": "https://techtarget.com/whatis/definition/ampere-per-meter-A-m-Oe-oersted"}, {"title": "Unit Of Magnetic Intensity: Definition & Explanation", "url": "https://digitalocean.wpcompress.com/blog/unit-of-magnetic-intensity-definition"}, {"title": "A permanent magnet in the shape of a thin cylinder of length 10cm has M=10 power6 A/M .calculate magnetization current?", "url": "https://www.careers360.com/question-a-permanent-magnet-in-the-shape-of-a-thin-cylinder-of-length-10cm-has-m10-power6-am-calculate-magnetization-current"}, {"title": "Understanding The Unit Of Magnetic Field Intensity", "url": "https://digitalocean.wpcompress.com/blog/understanding-the-unit-of-magnetic"}, {"title": "+1 500 000 products in offer", "url": "https://www.tme.com/ca/en/news/library-articles/glossary/page/69212/magnetisation-magnetisation-definition/"}, {"title": "www.careers360.com", "url": "https://www.careers360.com/question-a-permanent-magnet-in-the-shape-of-a-thin-cylinder-of-length-10cm-has-m10-power6-am-calculate-magnetization-current/amp"}, {"title": "EMC Question of the Week: September 14, 2020", "url": "https://learnemc.com/qotw-200914"}]}, "磁化强度的SI单位是安培每米（A/m），与磁场强度H的单位相同。\n\n- 按TME术语表的说法，磁化强度M是描述材料磁化程度的矢量量，表示单位体积内的磁矩数，并以A/m为单位。磁化强度是描述材料磁化程度的矢量物理量，即单位体积内的磁矩数。用M表示，其单位为安培每米（A/m）。\n- QUDT单位词条指出，A/m同时是磁场强度的SI单位，并且在\"单位体积磁偶极矩\"的意义上也是磁化强度的SI单位。它还给出换算：1 A/m 等于0.001 emu/cm³。它是磁场强度的SI单位。在\"磁偶极矩每单位体积\"的意义上，安培每米也是\"磁化强度\"的SI单位，此时1 A/m = 0.001 emu每立方厘米。\n- 另外，Oe（奥斯特）与A/m的换算常见为1 Oe ≈ 79.577 A/m，但Oe不属于SI单位。1 Oe = 79.577472 A/m\n\n注意：磁化强度与磁场强度虽然单位相同，物理含义不同。磁化强度是材料内部的磁矩密度，磁场强度H则是与材料性质无关的部分。"], "durationSeconds": 5.851077665999999, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_011fsyBvW8t1guQ8mmNRutYz", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgDXTPsXDRBrJDgbzcQXR", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**答案：安培每米（A/m）。**\n\n磁化强度 M 是单位体积内的磁矩，所以 SI 单位是 A/m。磁场强度 H 的单位也是 A/m，但两者物理含义不同。\n\n依据：\n- QUDT 的 A/m 条目说，A/m 在\"单位体积磁偶极矩\"的意义上是磁化强度的 SI 单位，并给出 1 A/m = 0.001 emu/cm³。\n- TME 术语表说，磁化强度是描述材料磁化程度的矢量，表示单位体积内的磁矩数，单位为 A/m。\n\nSources:\n- [QUDT: A PER M](https://qudt.org/vocab/unit/A-PER-M.html)\n- [TME: Magnetisation definition](https://www.tme.com/ca/en/news/library-articles/glossary/page/69212/magnetisation-magnetisation-definition/)"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1264, "cache_read_input_tokens": 4284, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1264}, "output_tokens": 314, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T12:56:26.255Z", "request_id": "req_011CgDXTPUxqpvgNugdYgu8x"}
